      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For the record here's an older report on this: https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/worlds-316-vrcinputfield-inputfield-no-longer-sends-onendedit-event\n\nBut DrBlackRat hit the nail on the head in regards to issues caused by using OnValueChanged. A nice and short way to put it :thumbs_up:",
